#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:6 083aa9e21c6e430381092411ef7b7b0d
msgid "Airbrakes"
msgstr "气动刹车"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:8 9927f272694d452da0e139f960b4eee7
msgid ""
"`Airbrakes <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Air_brake_(aeronautics)>`__ are "
"control surfaces that primarily add drag to your aircraft."
msgstr ""
"`气动刹车 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Air_brake_(aeronautics)>`__ "
"是主要为飞机增加阻力的控制面。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:10
#: 197b7308ac7e401c842b351e0fdf9274
msgid "These control surfaces can be driven by:"
msgstr "这些控制面可以通过以下方式驱动："

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:12
#: ed39e00d81014833bca6ec15be8da539
msgid "manual input via an RC channel."
msgstr "通过 RC 通道手动输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:13
#: 49b2fefd20424351bfb9953b7c632b4a
msgid ""
"automatic airbrake control, especially useful for steeper and more accurate "
"automatic landing."
msgstr "自动气动刹车控制，尤其适用于更陡峭、更精准的自动降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:14
#: fda4a094786f4e289e49de44e9084a80
msgid "a combination of both, in which case the greater value is used."
msgstr "两者结合，此时取较大值生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:17
#: 916e75dd000c4e898dc1eb3dbc1ea016
msgid "Servo Output"
msgstr "舵机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:19
#: 32a4670c4b0a4c738e744f7f37602a13
msgid ""
"Connect the airbrake servo to a servo output channel on your autopilot. Set "
"the corresponding servo output function to Airbrake (110). Set the servo "
"minimum value SERVOX_MIN to the value for airbrake fully retracted. Set the "
"maximum value SERVOX_MAX to the value for airbrake fully deployed."
msgstr ""
"将气动刹车舵机连接到飞控的舵机输出通道。将对应舵机输出功能设置为 Airbrake（110）。将舵机最小值 SERVOX_MIN "
"设置为气动刹车完全收回时的值，将最大值 SERVOX_MAX 设置为气动刹车完全展开时的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:24
#: 75c202f110184e25ac234cc58840bcf4
msgid "RC Channel Input"
msgstr "RC 通道输入"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:26
#: 4f8e929aef23421fbb7c33c7bc79ca06
msgid ""
"Assign a spare RC channel on your transmitter to a dial, slider or 3 "
"position switch. On the autopilot, ensure this channel is calibrated and "
"assign this channel the RC channel ``RCx_OPTION`` option Airbrake (210)."
msgstr ""
"在遥控器上为一个空闲 RC 通道分配旋钮、滑块或三段开关。在飞控上，确保该通道已校准，并为该通道的 RC 通道 ``RCx_OPTION`` 选项分配 "
"Airbrake（210）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:32
#: aec80d31735e48d4b0bfd57b30c28bbc
msgid "Automatic Airbrake Setup"
msgstr "自动气动刹车设置"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:34
#: 3205bbf70bad403fbb2aa9770e7e5bc7
msgid ""
"You can have airbrakes automatically used in an automated landing or in "
"conjunction with :ref:`Reverse Thrust<reverse-thrust-setup>` operation "
"during certain throttled controlled modes or automatic landings and "
"throttle-controlled descents, such as CRUISE mode while soaring. If manual "
"control of reverse thrust has been enabled using the ``RCX_OPTION`` (64) or "
"airbraking while in final flare in automatic landing using reverse thrust, "
"then the airbrake deployment will be the greater of either the automatic "
"demand or manual control."
msgstr ""
"您可以在自动降落或配合特定油门控制模式或自动降落及油门控制下降（如 CRUISE 模式滑翔时）使用 :ref:`反推力<reverse-thrust-"
"setup>` 操作时自动使用气动刹车。如果已使用 "
"``RCX_OPTION``（64）启用手动反推力控制，或在自动降落末段拉平时使用反推力进行气动刹车，则气动刹车展开量将取自动指令和手动控制中的较大值。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:37
#: 84ffd6ae79834e5ab31864f6efe1a7bf
msgid "Use With Reverse Thrust on Motor"
msgstr "与电机反推力配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:39
#: 004ec95eabdc4fdbb60a57b1d16cf6fd
msgid ""
"Setup :ref:`Reverse Thrust<reverse-thrust-setup>` as desired. Airbrake "
"operation will be in sync with reverse throttle applied."
msgstr "按需设置 :ref:`反推力<reverse-thrust-setup>`。气动刹车将与施加的反向油门同步运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:42
#: 2e1f0e26f65f4f8d9ea06e17dc6a412b
msgid "Use Without Reverse Thrust ESC"
msgstr "不使用反推力 ESC 时的配置"

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:44
#: 647eabebef604719954813e1464ac948
msgid "Same as above, however:"
msgstr "与上述相同，但需注意："

#: ../../source/docs/airbrakes-on-plane.rst:46
#: 1ec9e21927244fa7aab41f1101e9dc1a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM<SERVO3_TRIM>` = :ref:`SERVO3_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>` assuming"
" SERVO 3 output is the throttle. This will assure that low stick and minimum"
" demanded throttle is always SERVOx_MIN."
msgstr ""
"假设 SERVO 3 输出为油门，将 :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM<SERVO3_TRIM>` = "
":ref:`SERVO3_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>`。这将确保低油门杆和最小要求油门始终对应 SERVOx_MIN。"
